graphify-out/

# Local agent-tool working state. Both ship their own ignore file, but
# .superpowers/ only covers sdd/ — its root is exposed, so a tool writing
# directly there would be committable by `git add .`. Ignored here so the
# repo owns the rule rather than inheriting it from files those tools may
# rewrite on upgrade. .gstack/ holds browse daemon logs and an audit trail.
.gstack/
.superpowers/
